# <%= line(@harness.name) %> with <%= line(@wallet.name) %>

Roster versions are last seen; each run records the versions actually tested. Unknown means not recorded.

<%= if @selected_run do %>
## Selected run

Run ID: `<%= @selected_run.attempt_id %>`; test: `<%= @test %>`; outcome: `<%= @selected_run.outcome %>`.

<%= if @report do %>
The whole run, as Techtree published it: <%= Patchbay.WalletBench.PublicRun.source_url(@report["id"]) %>. Its results are in this page's JSON as `report`, with each step's prompt, the judge's reasoning and the files kept.

<%= for step <- @report["tests"] do %>
### <%= line(step["test"]) %> — <%= line((step["ruling"] && step["ruling"]["outcome"]) || step["state"]) %>

<%= line((step["ruling"] && step["ruling"]["summary"]) || "No summary recorded.") %>
<%= if step["storage_finding"], do: "How the wallet keeps its key: " <> line(step["storage_finding"]) <> "\n" %><%= if step["base_check"], do: "The bench's own check: " <> line(step["base_check"]) <> "\n" %>
- Time taken: <%= step["seconds"] || "not recorded" %> seconds
- Model cost, USD: <%= step["model_cost_usd"] || "not recorded" %>
- Judge cost, USD: <%= step["judge_cost_usd"] || "not recorded" %>
<%= for {check, number} <- Enum.with_index((step["ruling"] && step["ruling"]["checks"]) || [], 1) do %>
- C<%= number %>: <%= line(check["check"]) %> — <%= dot_answer(PatchbayWeb.WalletBenchRunHTML.answer_result(check["answer"])) %>. <%= line(check["why"] || "No reason recorded.") %><% end %>
<% end %>
<% else %>
The whole run did not load from Techtree just now; the results below are unchanged. [Read it on Techtree](<%= Patchbay.WalletBench.PublicRun.source_url(@selected_run.attempt_id) %>).
<% end %><% end %>

<%= if @harness.version, do: "- " <> line(@harness.name) <> ": " <> line(@harness.version) <> "\n" %><%= if @wallet.version, do: "- " <> line(@wallet.name) <> ": " <> line(@wallet.version) <> "\n" %><%= for {name, domain} <- forums(@harness, @wallet) do %>- [<%= line(name) %> forum](/<%= domain %>)
<% end %><%= if @shown do %>
Selected set: <%= line(Sets.label(@shown)) %>
<%= for {label, value} <- set_facts(@shown.summary) do %>
- <%= label %>: <%= value %><% end %>
<% end %>
<%= if @comparison do %>
## Version comparison

<%= line(@comparison.verdict) %>
<%= if @comparison.missing != [], do: "Not recorded: " <> Enum.join(@comparison.missing, ", ") <> ".\n" %>
<%= for change <- @comparison.differences do %>
- <%= change.key %>: <%= line(Sets.display(change.before)) %> → <%= line(Sets.display(change.after)) %><% end %>
<%= for {title, group} <- [{"Baseline", @comparison.baseline}, {"Compared", @comparison.compared}] do %>
### <%= title %>

<%= line(Sets.label(group)) %>
<%= for {label, value} <- set_facts(group.summary) do %>
- <%= label %>: <%= value %><% end %>
<%= for outcome <- outcomes(), Map.has_key?(group.outcomes, outcome) do %>
- <%= outcome %>: <%= group.outcomes[outcome] %> of <%= length(group.runs) %><% end %>
<%= for criterion <- group.criteria do %>
- <%= line(criterion.name) %>: <%= criterion.held %> of <%= criterion.runs %> held; <%= criterion.checked %> checked<% end %>
<% end %><% end %>

<%= for grid <- @grids do %>
## <%= grid_title(grid.grid) %>
<%= for fixed <- grid.fixed do %>
<%= word(@notes, fixed.fixed_outcome) %> (`<%= fixed.fixed_outcome %>`): <%= line(fixed.fixed_reason) %>
<% end %><%= if grid.runs == [] and grid.fixed == [], do: "\n" <> empty_grid(grid) <> "\n" %><%= for %{result: run, checks: checks} <- grid.runs do %>
### Run <%= run.run %>: <%= word(@notes, run.outcome) %> (`<%= run.outcome %>`)

<%= if !steps?(run) && plain_file(run.plain_file), do: "- " <> line(run.plain_file) <> "\n" %>- Finished: <%= stamp(run.finished_at) %>
- Run on techtree.sh: <%= run.run_url %>
<%= for {label, value} <- versions(run) do %>- <%= label %>: <%= line(value) %>
<% end %><%= if steps?(run) do %>
Steps, in order; the result is <%= line(deciding_step(run).name) %>'s:
<%= for step <- run.turns do %>
- <%= line(step.name) %>: <%= word(@notes, step.outcome) %> (`<%= step.outcome %>`)<%= if plain_file(step.plain_file), do: ", " <> line(step.plain_file) %>. <%= line(step.outcome_detail) %><% end %>

Checks, <%= line(deciding_step(run).name) %>:
<% else %>
<%= line(run.outcome_detail) %>
<% end %>
<%= for check <- checks do %>- <%= line(check.criterion) %>: <%= check_said(check.result) %>. <%= line(check.reason) %>
<% end %><% end %><% end %>
<%= extra_notes(%{releases: @extra_notes, said: @notes["extra_notes"]}) %>
<%= trailer() %>
